url: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23023658"
abstract: >-
  LDAttention is a locus-level transformer that learns linkage disequilibrium
  through self-attention without a precomputed pairwise r² matrix. An optional
  additive layer, LDAttentionBias, injects learned genomic-distance and
  low-rank context terms into attention logits. This repository provides the
  Python package, simulation-based evaluation protocol, baselines, reported
  result tables, and figure-generation scripts accompanying a forthcoming
  manuscript.
keywords:
  - linkage disequilibrium
  - transformers
  - attention
  - genotype imputation
  - genomics
  - machine learning
